#X obj 616 11 synth.voice_fofc~;
#X obj 230 93 cnv 1 535 230 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -257983 -1 0;
#X text 240 98 Simple formant/vocal synthesizer based on a source/filter
model. The source is just a periodic impulse and the "filter" is a
bank of FOF filters.;
#X text 240 153 Formant parameters are linearly interpolated allowing
to go smoothly from one vowel to another. Voice type can be selected
but must correspond to the frequency range of the synthesized voice
to be realistic.;
#X text 240 238 A cycle of 12 FOF filters with sample-and-hold is used
so that the fof filter parameters can be varied in realtime.;
#X text 240 278 This technique is more robust but more computationally
expensive than FofSmooth;
